tempered (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First release: tempered reads a PCsensor TEMPerGold over hidraw
    (read, info, log), and tempered daemon presents it as a Linux IIO
    device through /dev/uhid, linked as /run/tempered/<label>.

